                            <td><a target="_blank" href="https://cdn.tbmm.gov.tr/KKBSPublicFile/D28/Y5/T2/WebOnergeMetni/e6e04773-6fcf-4665-8a8e-bc9ab3300f97.pdf">Kanun Teklifinin Metni</a></td>
